From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herrie <Github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:53:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: drop the undefined 'media' ACG

'media' is a legacy access control group name; umediaserver declares
media.operation, media.query and media.devutility, so the requested
group does not exist:

WARNING: luneos-dev-image-1.0-r0 do_validate_ls2_acg: Found 17 group(s) used in client-permissions.d but not defined
'media' being used in:
  com.webos.app.enactbrowser.app.json

media.operation is already requested on the next lines, so the entry
can simply go.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.app.enactbrowser.perm.json | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/files/sysbus/com.webos.app.enactbrowser.perm.json b/files/sysbus/com.webos.app.enactbrowser.perm.json
index f79b289..c43047b 100644
--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.app.enactbrowser.perm.json
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.app.enactbrowser.perm.json
@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@
 {
     "com.webos.app.enactbrowser*": [
-        "media",
         "application.operation",
         "settings.query",
         "media.operation",
